sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Auth as Auth Module
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Cache as Redis

    %% Login Flow
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>Auth: authenticate_user(email, password)
    Auth->>DB: SELECT user by email
    DB-->>Auth: User record
    Auth->>Auth: Verify password (bcrypt)
    Auth->>Auth: Generate JWT tokens
    Auth->>Cache: Store refresh token
    Auth-->>API: {access_token, refresh_token}
    API-->>C: 200 OK + tokens

    %% Authenticated Request
    C->>API: GET /api/v1/notes
    Note right of C: Authorization: Bearer {access_token}
    API->>Auth: validate_token(access_token)
    Auth->>Auth: Decode & verify JWT
    Auth-->>API: user_id
    API->>DB: SELECT notes WHERE user_id = ?
    DB-->>API: Notes list
    API-->>C: 200 OK + notes

    %% Token Refresh
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh
    Note right of C: Cookie: refresh_token
    API->>Auth: refresh_access_token(refresh_token)
    Auth->>Cache: Validate refresh token
    Cache-->>Auth: Valid
    Auth->>Auth: Generate new tokens
    Auth->>Cache: Rotate refresh token
    Auth-->>API: {access_token, refresh_token}
    API-->>C: 200 OK + new tokens

    %% Logout
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/logout
    API->>Auth: revoke_token(refresh_token)
    Auth->>Cache: Delete refresh token
    Auth-->>API: Success
    API-->>C: 200 OK
